{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"duration","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customError","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"},{"text":")? = nil) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Timeout","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SuspendingClock","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency15SuspendingClockV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"duration","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The longest the sequence may go without an element."}]}]},{"name":"customError","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The error to throw when the timer fires. Defaults to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"TimeoutError.timedOut(duration:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the same elements that throws if the upstream goes quiet."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The timer starts when iteration begins and restarts with every element, so it bounds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wait for the first element and each gap after it, never the sequence as a whole. Elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass through unchanged. When the timer fires, the upstream is cancelled and the sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and elements it produces while the consumer is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"busy are buffered, so the timer measures the upstream’s gaps. A duration of zero or less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws before the first element."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example"},{"code":["for try await event in serverEvents.timeout(.seconds(30)) {","    handle(event)","}","\/\/ Throws TimeoutError.timedOut if 30 seconds pass without an event"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeoutError"},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"customError"},{"type":"text","text":") when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"duration"},{"type":"text","text":" passes between elements, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any error the upstream throws."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/ReplaceNil"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncs